WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.525
Unit twenty-five. My Health Habits!

2
00:00:04.476 --> 00:00:08.017
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.067 --> 00:00:11.468
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.518 --> 00:00:15.101
Today we learn about My Health Habits. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.894 --> 00:00:19.061
Habit. Say it with me. Habit!

6
00:00:22.542 --> 00:00:26.608
Handwashing. Say it with me. Handwashing!

7
00:00:30.107 --> 00:00:33.640
Sleep. Say it with me. Sleep!

8
00:00:37.162 --> 00:00:40.529
Water. Say it with me. Water!

9
00:00:44.026 --> 00:00:48.042
Exercise. Say it with me. Exercise!

10
00:00:51.542 --> 00:00:54.592
Fruit. Say it with me. Fruit!

11
00:00:58.096 --> 00:01:01.462
Brush. Say it with me. Brush!

12
00:01:04.962 --> 00:01:08.012
Goal. Say it with me. Goal!

13
00:01:11.516 --> 00:01:20.364
Healthy habits keep me strong: handwashing, sleep, water, exercise, fruit, and brushing my teeth. I set one goal and practise it every day.

14
00:01:20.414 --> 00:01:21.752
I can do that too!

15
00:01:23.066 --> 00:01:28.335
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:28.385 --> 00:01:29.535
Sleep!

17
00:01:30.424 --> 00:01:35.641
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:35.691 --> 00:01:36.841
Brush!

19
00:01:37.651 --> 00:01:42.031
Did you know? A checklist can help you remember healthy habits each day!

20
00:01:42.081 --> 00:01:44.085
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:45.502 --> 00:01:53.234
Think and answer. Which healthy habit do you want to improve?

22
00:01:53.284 --> 00:01:54.434
Great answer!

23
00:01:55.638 --> 00:02:03.284
Wonderful work, everyone! You finished Health Grade 3. Keep your healthy habits, and see you in Grade 4. Goodbye!

24
00:02:03.334 --> 00:02:06.457
Thank you, Nurse Bopha! See you in Grade 4!

